---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} jsonld={jsonld} navVariant="inner">
<section class="hero">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow">Services</span>
<h1>Every service you need, from deposit to delivery</h1>
<p class="lead">Verification before you commit. Monitoring while you wait. Inspection before you pay. Each one is buyer-paid, standards-referenced, and photographed—because trust without evidence is just hope.</p>
<div class="hero-ctas"><a class="btn btn-solid" href="/#book">Book an inspection</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/why-independent/">Why independent</a></div>
</div>
</section>
<section><div class="wrap"><div class="grid"><a class="card rv" href="/supplier-verification-india/"><h3>Supplier Verification</h3><p>Real manufacturer or trader? Unannounced premises visit, documents, export history. Verdict in 3 working days.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/factory-audit-india/"><h3>Factory Audit</h3><p>Process, QC system, real capacity and the subcontracting map — scored across 8 sections in one day on site.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/supplier-shortlisting/"><h3>Supplier Shortlisting</h3><p>Fixed-fee, buyer-paid shortlisting with zero factory commission, firewalled under our Independence Charter.</p></a></div></div></section><section><div class="wrap"><div class="grid"><a class="card rv" href="/production-monitoring-india/"><h3>Production Monitoring</h3><p>Scheduled and unannounced visits through your production run, with photo reports at every milestone.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/during-production-inspection/"><h3>During-Production Inspection</h3><p>Catch defects at 20–50% complete — when rework is cheap and the vessel date is still safe.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/monsoon-watch/"><h3>Monsoon Watch</h3><p>Seasonal advisories on moisture, curing and lead-time risk from inside the clusters, July to September.</p></a></div></div></section><section><div class="wrap"><div class="grid"><a class="card rv" href="/pre-shipment-inspection-india/"><h3>Pre-Shipment Inspection</h3><p>AQL 2.5 sampling, moisture, structure, finish vs golden sample. Photographed report within 24 hours.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/container-loading-supervision/"><h3>Container Loading Supervision</h3><p>Container condition, full tally, dunnage, weather hold and the seal photographed at the door.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/packaging-transit-validation/"><h3>Packaging &amp; Transit Validation</h3><p>ISTA 3A drop tests and packaging spec review for flat-pack and e-commerce furniture.</p></a></div></div></section><section><div class="wrap"><div class="grid"><a class="card rv" href="/first-order-shield/"><h3>First Order Shield</h3><p>Verification + DUPRO + PSI in one package — built for your first India order.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/pre-shipment-inspection-india/"><h3>Protected Container</h3><p>PSI + Container Loading Supervision with priority 12-hour reporting.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/#book"><h3>Verified Supplier Programme</h3><p>Audit + verification + ongoing monitoring for programme vendors. Ask us.</p></a></div></div></section>
<section class="final">
<div class="wrap">

<h2>Your next India order. Protected.</h2>
<p>Confirmed within 2 hours. Report within 24 hours of inspection. Paid by buyers only — never by factories.</p>
<a class="btn btn-solid" href="/#book">Book an inspection</a>
</div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
